
# 1. Singly Linked List

## Question Description
Implement a Singly Linked List in C++ using dynamic memory allocation. Insert elements at the end and display the linked list.

## Test Cases

### Test Case 1
Input: `10, 20, 30`

Expected Output:
`10 -> 20 -> 30 -> NULL`

### Test Case 2
Input: `5, 15`

Expected Output:
`5 -> 15 -> NULL`

### Test Case 3
Input: `7`

Expected Output:
`7 -> NULL`

## Time Complexity
- Insert at end: O(n) per insertion
- Display: O(n)

## Space Complexity
- O(n)
